@flexiarg operator/ask-for-the-environment-act
@title Ask The Agent To Make The Environment Ready, In One Line
@status accepted 2026-11-11: proposed by 象 for 2 turns (Joe 2026-11-11: recurrence suffices); attested once used in a mission or a War Machine cascade
@provenance 象 proposals, ~/.emacs-graph/session-turn-analysis/<record>[.json].candidates.json; records: turn-0GAJoj turn-VJBAnL; first proposed for: Joe needs a physical or system resource (a backup drive) available before work can continue.
@why [operator/commission-the-smallest-reviewable-act]

! conclusion: say the one act, name the object, and add 'now'; the agent does it and reports the result

  + IF:
    a resource must be attached or enabled and the agent has host access

  + HOWEVER:
    it is a mundane act with no spec, review or check attached, so no existing delegation pattern fits

  + THEN:
    say the one act, name the object, and add 'now'; the agent does it and reports the result

  + BECAUSE:
    the act is small enough that the request is the whole specification
